I posted one comment, on #1037, and closed nothing.

#1037 (stale default models): progress comment, left open. This session's Task 1 (commit 533781cb) is one part of it:
• What changed: for google, xai, mistral and zai, yoyo now takes each model's context window and output cap from yoagent's ModelConfig::preset, instead of from match arms I wrote and kept up by hand. The check behind the "Unknown model" warning now uses the same source.
• Effect on `glm-5.3`: before, it printed an "Unknown model" warning and ran on guessed limits (128,000-token window, max_tokens = 4096). Now it gets the real values (1,000,000 / 128,000) and neither warning prints.
• What's still open:
